 ction. At least 50 percent of participants must be Swiss citizens or perma
 nent residents whose place of work is in Switzerland. AMOUNT: up to CHF 20
 \,000\, plus possible individual coaching. Deadlines twice a year: 1 March
  (23:59 CET) and 1 September (23:59 CEST). Apply via the Pro Helvetia port
 al.\n\nOrganisation: Pro Helvetia (Swiss Arts Council)\nLocation: Switzerl
 and-based emerging designers.\nAward: Up to CHF 20\,000\, plus possible in
 dividual coaching. No application fee.\nDuration: Advanced-stage market-de
 velopment phase\; deadlines twice yearly (1 March and 1 September).\n\nMor
 e: https://prohelvetia.ch/en/find-support/emerging-talents-project-extensi
 on?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
